{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And he shall place the incense.</b> For it is stated above, ״for in a cloud I will appear upon the cover,״ and so as not to gaze at the Shekhinah, as it is written, ״for no man shall see Me and live,״ he must darken the house first by placing the incense — this is what is meant by <b>and the cloud of the incense shall cover the cover</b> — and afterward he shall bring the blood there."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:48.224026282Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}